    "known_limits": [
      "The four-state Gmail readiness contract and runtime/11 bounded extraction retry create a new unreviewed draft lineage; prior receipts do not validate this execution contract.",
      "Search submission fails closed unless the current Gmail URL, after bounded percent-decoding, contains the exact #search/{{query}} route; inbox-root rows cannot satisfy this proof.",
      "Mailbox ready, results available, accessible no-results, and transient/loading are separate states; a persistent transient state fails closed after one bounded retry.",
      "The Gmail row and field locators were observed in one authorized account, but this updated contract requires renewed query-scoped authoring review and two clean runtime replays.",
      "The accessible no-results labels may vary by locale; a new semantic variant requires bounded model-led recovery and operator review before persistence."
    ],
    "receipts": []
  },
